-- Imported verbatim from the Luau conformance suite (luau-lang/luau),
-- tests/conformance/math.luau at commit 86d2a9d.
-- See README.md and LICENSE in this directory for provenance and licensing.
--
-- conformance: pending
-- Waluau cannot infer a concrete numeric overload for math.abs from this
-- untyped helper's dynamic parameters. Remove this directive when dynamic
-- numeric arithmetic and math-library overload dispatch are supported.
--
-- Split from conformance/luau/math.4.walu in original source order.
-- Upstream source lines 77-80. The helper is retained as an independently
-- visible gap even though the following scientific-notation assertion does
-- not call it.

function eq (a,b,limit)
  if not limit then limit = 10E-10 end
  return math.abs(a-b) <= limit
end
